  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; 在殭屍與Z病毒的統治下，人類的社會幾乎滅亡，但部分倖存者仍生活在散落世界各地的聚落中，一些科技也得以保留。為了適應極端環境，他們利用銅材研發新技術，期盼著嶄新的未來。然而，由於Z病毒長期肆虐，世界上出現了新的病毒變種，將更多生物轉化為殭屍。人類能否適應這些新型殭屍變種，還是會徹底滅亡？</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; 主要特色/模組：</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 全新感染機制</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 更優化的建築生成</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 更多殭屍變種</p>\n<p>也歡迎體驗我的其他專案：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/actual-mobs-smarter-and-stronger-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">實際生物</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/golden-memory-legend-of-the-past\" rel=\"nofollow\">黃金記憶：往昔傳說</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/horror-from-the-zombie-horde\" rel=\"nofollow\">殭屍大軍中的恐怖</a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/minetimizations-the-optimize-modpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minetimizations</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/optivanilla-improve-performance-and-experience\" rel=\"nofollow\">Opticraft - 提升效能與體驗</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/plague-earth-the-true-apocalypse\" rel=\"nofollow\">瘟疫地球：真正的末日</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/plague-earth-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">瘟疫地球 2</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/world-war-z-low-end-pc-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">World War Z - 輕量版</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/world-war-z-nether-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">World War Z - 地獄版</a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/world-war-z-the-chamber\" rel=\"nofollow\">World War Z - 密室篇</a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/world-war-z-forge-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;World War Z - 殭屍時代</a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/world-war-z-warden-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">World War Z - 典獄長版</a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 以及 WWZ 系列模組包舊版本中的幾乎所有其他機制</p>",
